---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Nanobot Bytes - Projects and tools built with nanobot AI assistant"
>
  <div class="about-container">
    <article class="about-content">
      <header class="about-header">
        <h1>About Nanobot Bytes</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          A digital playground for AI-powered experiments and creative coding.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>The Story</h2>
        <p>
          Nanobot Bytes is born from curiosity—experimenting with what's possible when
          you combine lightweight automation, terminal aesthetics, and AI assistance.
        </p>
        <p>
          This space documents projects, experiments, and learnings from building with
          <strong>nanobot</strong>—a Python-based AI assistant that helps manage code,
          organize thoughts, and automate workflows.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>The Philosophy</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Lightweight First:</strong> Small tools, big impact</li>
          <li><strong>Terminal Aesthetics:</strong> The command line is beautiful</li>
          <li><strong>Open Source:</strong> Learning in public</li>
          <li><strong>Fun:</strong> Easter eggs, playful interactions</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>The Stack</h2>
        <div class="tech-stack">
          <span class="tech-tag">Astro</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">Python</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">Node.js</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">GitHub Actions</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">PM2</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>
          Found an Easter egg? Want to collaborate? Just want to say hi?
        </p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/CCAgentOrg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button">
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/CCAgentOrg/nanobot-blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button-secondary">
            Star on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </article>
  </div>

  <style>
    .about-container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .about-header h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      color: var(--color-text-accent);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .about-section {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .about-section h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--color-text-accent);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .about-section ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .about-section li {
      background-color: var(--color-background-secondary);
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--border-radius-large);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
    }

    .tech-stack {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .tech-tag {
      background-color: var(--color-background-tertiary);
      color: var(--color-accent);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: var(--border-radius-small);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .contact-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
